{
  "nodes": [
    {"id": "doc", "type": "file", "file": "docs/network/box-network.md", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 440, "height": 320},
    {"id": "status", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": -140, "width": 440, "height": 110, "color": "1", "text": "## The box network\nProposal, 2026-11-03. AI-UI side: Alexander decides. Tinker.Click side: a proposal until the Tinker.Click team agrees. Nothing is built."},
    {"id": "g-roles", "type": "group", "label": "Roles: the ladder", "x": 500, "y": -140, "width": 1040, "height": 500},
    {"id": "guest", "type": "text", "x": 520, "y": -90, "width": 230, "height": 190, "color": "4", "text": "**Guest**\nA trial seat with an end date and a model budget.\nBox role: `temporary`\nOpened by a **guest pass**"},
    {"id": "member", "type": "text", "x": 780, "y": -90, "width": 230, "height": 190, "color": "4", "text": "**Member**\nA seat that stays, paid or sponsored.\nBox role: `user`\nPrice at or above the network floor"},
    {"id": "ownbox", "type": "text", "x": 1040, "y": -90, "width": 230, "height": 190, "color": "4", "text": "**Own managed box**\nThe steward runs it.\nPlans by seats, model budget and storage"},
    {"id": "host", "type": "text", "x": 1300, "y": -90, "width": 220, "height": 190, "color": "4", "text": "**Host**\nRuns a box in the network and earns from it.\nBox role: `admin`\nManaged host or vetted host"},
    {"id": "independent", "type": "text", "x": 780, "y": 160, "width": 490, "height": 170, "color": "4", "text": "**Independent**\nAnyone may run the AGPL software outside the network: no listing, no pool.\nOnce the team vets the box, it joins as a **vetted host**."},
    {"id": "steward", "type": "text", "x": 500, "y": 420, "width": 340, "height": 230, "color": "6", "text": "**Steward** (Sage.is and the team)\n- the directory\n- vetting, by the host covenant\n- the pool of guest passes\n- the floor price and the fee band"},
    {"id": "g-pool", "type": "group", "label": "The pool: capacity-backed passes", "x": 900, "y": 420, "width": 640, "height": 330},
    {"id": "p1", "type": "text", "x": 920, "y": 470, "width": 290, "height": 120, "color": "5", "text": "1. A host commits spare seats"},
    {"id": "p2", "type": "text", "x": 1230, "y": 470, "width": 290, "height": 120, "color": "5", "text": "2. The steward mints guest passes against them"},
    {"id": "p3", "type": "text", "x": 1230, "y": 610, "width": 290, "height": 120, "color": "5", "text": "3. A guest redeems on a box that fits their language and region; their email goes to the host"},
    {"id": "p4", "type": "text", "x": 920, "y": 610, "width": 290, "height": 120, "color": "5", "text": "4. The guest stays as a member: the host earns, and the seat leaves the pool"},
    {"id": "codes", "type": "text", "x": 1600, "y": -140, "width": 400, "height": 330, "color": "3", "text": "## Code names (proposal)\n- **Guest pass**: opens a guest seat for a set time\n- **Referral code**: opens nothing; credits who sent a person\n- **Pilot**: the sales path to a managed box; a form, not a code\n- **Invite**: the plain word in copy\n\nOne mechanism: AI-UI magic links (`max_uses`, `expires_at`, `account_duration`, `role`, `meta`)."},
    {"id": "covenant", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 380, "width": 440, "height": 460, "color": "2", "text": "## Draft host covenant\n1. A supported release, updated after a security release\n2. Privacy filter on for every external connection; never off for guests\n3. Daily encrypted backups, tested restore\n4. A second person with emergency access\n5. 3 months' notice before shutdown, with an export\n6. A model budget per seat; provider spend caps\n7. Data stays in the box; capacity numbers leave with consent\n8. A named, reachable operator; the code of conduct\n9. A health and capacity report"},
    {"id": "interop", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 900, "width": 440, "height": 340, "text": "## Interop\nSeams already planned:\n- AI-UI as a sign-in provider\n- the model gateway (Rootstock F2)\n- the Tinker.Click library as a Sprig (F5)\n- the bridge contract\n\nThe network adds: a directory, a pass service, export and move."},
    {"id": "g-phases", "type": "group", "label": "Phases (no dates)", "x": 500, "y": 820, "width": 1040, "height": 260},
    {"id": "ph1", "type": "text", "x": 520, "y": 870, "width": 320, "height": 180, "text": "**1. Our boxes only**\nGuest passes as magic links per channel. Referral codes on the pilot form; leads in Trellis. A one-page directory."},
    {"id": "ph2", "type": "text", "x": 860, "y": 870, "width": 320, "height": 180, "text": "**2. Vetted hosts**\nManaged hosts, then vetted independents. Covenant, floor price, capacity-backed passes. Hosts bill their members."},
    {"id": "ph3", "type": "text", "x": 1200, "y": 870, "width": 320, "height": 180, "text": "**3. Payouts and moves**\nFee split, sign-in across boxes, export and move. Tinker.Click boxes join once the team agrees."},
    {"id": "decisions", "type": "text", "x": 1600, "y": 250, "width": 400, "height": 500, "color": "1", "text": "## Decisions for Alexander\n1. Roles: guest, member, host, steward; managed and vetted hosts?\n2. Code names: guest pass and referral code?\n3. The floor per seat, and the fee band\n4. The guest seat's length and model budget\n5. The covenant's items; who vets\n6. The directory's home: community.sage.is?\n7. No payouts in phases 1 and 2?\n8. Vetted hosts behind Cloudflare?\n9. Tinker.Click boxes: the Tinker.Click team decides"},
    {"id": "parked", "type": "text", "x": 500, "y": 1120, "width": 1040, "height": 150, "text": "**Parked: IPFS mirrors** (2026-11-03)\nMember boxes pin each other’s public, unchanging files: Sprig images and catalog, release files, published Tinker apps. Anyone can mirror and check a copy by its content ID. Never private data; a file lives only while someone pins it."}
  ],
